--------------------------- MODULE x_unchanged ----------------------------
EXTENDS TLA

VARIABLES x, y, z

Init ==
  /\ x \in {1, 2, 3}
  /\ y \in {1, 2, 3}
  /\ z \in {1, 2, 3}

Next ==
  /\ UNCHANGED <<x, z>>
  /\ y' = y + 1

Spec == Init /\ [] [Next]_<<x, y, z>>

=============================================================================